NCT04782791.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Non-bedridden, aged 18 to 70 years old;
* Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG) score is 0 to 1;
* Histologically confirmed gastric adenocarcinoma;
